1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,420
I can't force you to love me, because love was never meant to be forced.

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:07,340
It has to come from your own heart.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,400
But there's one thing I need you to know.

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:16,640
I will always be here, not because I have to, but because I chose to.

5
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:23,860
No matter how much time passes, somewhere inside my heart, a part of me is still waiting

6
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:24,460
for you.
